  "project_description": "Provides a Drupal field type for storing a CSS size: a numeric value paired with a CSS length unit (px, em, rem, %, vw, vh, cm, mm, Q, in, pc, pt). Ships a default widget (number input plus a unit selector, with configurable default and allowed units), a default formatter that renders the value as a concatenated CSS string (e.g. \"20px\"), and a reusable 'css_size' form element for use outside the Field API.",
